  "ja545:0.4": "1153. 545. Mahānāradakassapajātakaṃ (8) ",
  "ja545:1.1": "‘‘Ahu rājā videhānaṃ, ",
  "ja545:1.2": "aṅgati nāma khattiyo; ",
  "ja545:1.3": "Pahūtayoggo dhanimā, ",
  "ja545:1.4": "anantabalaporiso. ",
  "ja545:2.1": "1154. So ca pannarasiṃ rattiṃ, ",
  "ja545:2.2": "purimayāme anāgate; ",
  "ja545:2.3": "Cātumāsā komudiyā, ",
  "ja545:2.4": "amacce sannipātayi. ",
  "ja545:3.1": "1155. ‘‘Paṇḍite sutasampanne, ",
  "ja545:3.2": "mitapubbe vicakkhaṇe; ",
  "ja545:3.3": "Vijayañca sunāmañca, ",
  "ja545:3.4": "senāpatiṃ alātakaṃ. ",
  "ja545:4.1": "1156. ‘‘Tamanupucchi vedeho, ",
  "ja545:4.2": "‘‘paccekaṃ brūtha saṃ ruciṃ; ",
  "ja545:4.3": "Cātumāsā komudajja, ",
  "ja545:4.4": "juṇhaṃ byapahataṃ tamaṃ; ",
  "ja545:4.5": "Kāyajja ratiyā rattiṃ, ",
  "ja545:4.6": "viharemu imaṃ utuṃ’’. ",
  "ja545:5.1": "1157. ‘‘Tato senāpati rañño, ",
  "ja545:5.2": "alāto etadabravi; ",
  "ja545:5.3": "‘‘Haṭṭhaṃ yoggaṃ balaṃ sabbaṃ, ",
  "ja545:5.4": "senaṃ sannāhayāmase. ",
  "ja545:6.1": "1158. ‘‘Niyyāma deva yuddhāya, ",
  "ja545:6.2": "anantabalaporisā; ",
  "ja545:6.3": "Ye te vasaṃ na āyanti, ",
  "ja545:6.4": "vasaṃ upanayāmase ; ",
  "ja545:6.5": "Esā mayhaṃ sakā diṭṭhi, ",
  "ja545:6.6": "ajitaṃ ojināmase. ",
  "ja545:7.1": "1159. Alātassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:7.2": "sunāmo etadabravi; ",
  "ja545:7.3": "‘‘Sabbe tuyhaṃ mahārāja, ",
  "ja545:7.4": "amittā vasamāgatā. ",
  "ja545:8.1": "1160. ‘‘Nikkhittasatthā paccatthā, ",
  "ja545:8.2": "nivātamanuvattare; ",
  "ja545:8.3": "Uttamo ussavo ajja, ",
  "ja545:8.4": "na yuddhaṃ mama ruccati. ",
  "ja545:9.1": "1161. ‘‘Annapānañca khajjañca, ",
  "ja545:9.2": "khippaṃ abhiharantu te; ",
  "ja545:9.3": "Ramassu deva kāmehi, ",
  "ja545:9.4": "naccagīte suvādite’’. ",
  "ja545:10.1": "1162. Sunāmassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:10.2": "vijayo etadabravi; ",
  "ja545:10.3": "‘‘Sabbe kāmā mahārāja, ",
  "ja545:10.4": "niccaṃ tava mupaṭṭhitā. ",
  "ja545:11.1": "1163. ‘‘Na hete dullabhā deva, ",
  "ja545:11.2": "tava kāmehi modituṃ; ",
  "ja545:11.3": "Sadāpi kāmā sulabhā, ",
  "ja545:11.4": "netaṃ cittamataṃ mama. ",
  "ja545:12.1": "1164. ‘‘Samaṇaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ vāpi, ",
  "ja545:12.2": "upāsemu bahussutaṃ; ",
  "ja545:12.3": "Yo najja vinaye kaṅkhaṃ, ",
  "ja545:12.4": "atthadhammavidū ise’’. ",
  "ja545:13.1": "1165. Vijayassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:13.2": "rājā aṅgati mabravi; ",
  "ja545:13.3": "‘‘Yathā vijayo bhaṇati, ",
  "ja545:13.4": "mayhampetaṃva ruccati. ",
  "ja545:14.1": "1166. ‘‘Samaṇaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ vāpi, ",
  "ja545:14.2": "upāsemu bahussutaṃ; ",
  "ja545:14.3": "Yo najja vinaye kaṅkhaṃ, ",
  "ja545:14.4": "atthadhammavidū ise. ",
  "ja545:15.1": "1167. ‘‘Sabbeva santā karotha matiṃ, ",
  "ja545:15.2": "kaṃ upāsemu paṇḍitaṃ; ",
  "ja545:15.3": "Yo najja vinaye kaṅkhaṃ, ",
  "ja545:15.4": "atthadhammavidū ise’’. ",
  "ja545:16.1": "1168. ‘‘Vedehassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:16.2": "alāto etadabravi; ",
  "ja545:16.3": "‘‘Atthāyaṃ migadāyasmiṃ, ",
  "ja545:16.4": "acelo dhīrasammato. ",
  "ja545:17.1": "1169. ‘‘Guṇo kassapagottāyaṃ, ",
  "ja545:17.2": "suto citrakathī gaṇī; ",
  "ja545:17.3": "Taṃ deva payirupāsemu , ",
  "ja545:17.4": "so no kaṅkhaṃ vinessati’’. ",
  "ja545:18.1": "1170. ‘‘Alātassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:18.2": "rājā codesi sārathiṃ; ",
  "ja545:18.3": "‘‘Migadāyaṃ gamissāma, ",
  "ja545:18.4": "yuttaṃ yānaṃ idhānaya’’. ",
  "ja545:19.1": "1171. Tassa yānaṃ ayojesuṃ, ",
  "ja545:19.2": "dantaṃ rūpiyapakkharaṃ ; ",
  "ja545:19.3": "Sukkamaṭṭhaparivāraṃ, ",
  "ja545:19.4": "paṇḍaraṃ dosināmukhaṃ. ",
  "ja545:20.1": "1172. ‘‘Tatrāsuṃ kumudāyuttā, ",
  "ja545:20.2": "cattāro sindhavā hayā; ",
  "ja545:20.3": "Anilūpamasamuppātā , ",
  "ja545:20.4": "sudantā soṇṇamālino. ",
  "ja545:21.1": "1173. ‘‘Setacchattaṃ setaratho, ",
  "ja545:21.2": "setassā setabījanī; ",
  "ja545:21.3": "Vedeho sahamaccehi, ",
  "ja545:21.4": "niyyaṃ candova sobhati. ",
  "ja545:22.1": "1174. ‘‘Tamanuyāyiṃsu bahavo, ",
  "ja545:22.2": "indikhaggadharā balī; ",
  "ja545:22.3": "Assapiṭṭhigatā vīrā, ",
  "ja545:22.4": "narā naravarādhipaṃ. ",
  "ja545:23.1": "1175. So muhuttaṃva yāyitvā, ",
  "ja545:23.2": "yānā oruyha khattiyo; ",
  "ja545:23.3": "Vedeho sahamaccehi, ",
  "ja545:23.4": "pattī guṇamupāgami. ",
  "ja545:24.1": "1176. Yepi tattha tadā āsuṃ, ",
  "ja545:24.2": "brāhmaṇibbhā samāgatā; ",
  "ja545:24.3": "Na te apanayī rājā, ",
  "ja545:24.4": "akataṃ bhūmimāgate. ",
  "ja545:25.1": "1177. ‘‘Tato so mudukā bhisiyā, ",
  "ja545:25.2": "muducittakasanthate ; ",
  "ja545:25.3": "Mudupaccatthate rājā, ",
  "ja545:25.4": "ekamantaṃ upāvisi. ",
  "ja545:26.1": "1178. ‘‘Nisajja rājā sammodi, ",
  "ja545:26.2": "kathaṃ sāraṇiyaṃ tato; ",
  "ja545:26.3": "‘‘Kacci yāpaniyaṃ bhante, ",
  "ja545:26.4": "vātānamaviyaggatā . ",
  "ja545:27.1": "1179. ‘‘Kacci akasirā vutti, ",
  "ja545:27.2": "labhasi piṇḍayāpanaṃ ; ",
  "ja545:27.3": "Apābādho casi kacci, ",
  "ja545:27.4": "cakkhuṃ na parihāyati’’. ",
  "ja545:28.1": "1180. Taṃ guṇo paṭisammodi, ",
  "ja545:28.2": "vedehaṃ vinaye rataṃ; ",
  "ja545:28.3": "‘‘Yāpanīyaṃ mahārāja, ",
  "ja545:28.4": "sabbametaṃ tadūbhayaṃ. ",
  "ja545:29.1": "1181. ‘‘Kacci tuyhampi vedeha, ",
  "ja545:29.2": "paccantā na balīyare; ",
  "ja545:29.3": "Kacci arogaṃ yoggaṃ te, ",
  "ja545:29.4": "kacci vahati vāhanaṃ; ",
  "ja545:29.5": "Kacci te byādhayo natthi, ",
  "ja545:29.6": "sarīrassupatāpiyā’’ . ",
  "ja545:30.1": "1182. Paṭisammodito rājā, ",
  "ja545:30.2": "tato pucchi anantarā; ",
  "ja545:30.3": "Atthaṃ dhammañca ñāyañca, ",
  "ja545:30.4": "dhammakāmo rathesabho. ",
  "ja545:31.1": "1183. ‘‘Kathaṃ dhammaṃ care macco, ",
  "ja545:31.2": "mātāpitūsu kassapa; ",
  "ja545:31.3": "Kathaṃ care ācariye, ",
  "ja545:31.4": "puttadāre kathaṃ care. ",
  "ja545:32.1": "1184. ‘‘Kathaṃ careyya vuḍḍhesu, ",
  "ja545:32.2": "kathaṃ samaṇabrāhmaṇe; ",
  "ja545:32.3": "Kathañca balakāyasmiṃ, ",
  "ja545:32.4": "kathaṃ janapade care. ",
  "ja545:33.1": "1185. ‘‘Kathaṃ dhammaṃ caritvāna, ",
  "ja545:33.2": "maccā gacchanti suggatiṃ; ",
  "ja545:33.3": "Kathañceke adhammaṭṭhā, ",
  "ja545:33.4": "patanti nirayaṃ atho’’. ",
  "ja545:34.1": "1186. ‘‘Vedehassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:34.2": "kassapo etadabravi; ",
  "ja545:34.3": "‘‘‘Suṇohi me mahārāja, ",
  "ja545:34.4": "saccaṃ avitathaṃ padaṃ. ",
  "ja545:35.1": "1187. ‘‘‘Natthi dhammacaritassa , ",
  "ja545:35.2": "phalaṃ kalyāṇapāpakaṃ; ",
  "ja545:35.3": "Natthi deva paro loko, ",
  "ja545:35.4": "ko tato hi idhāgato. ",
  "ja545:36.1": "1188. ‘‘‘Natthi deva pitaro vā, ",
  "ja545:36.2": "kuto mātā kuto pitā; ",
  "ja545:36.3": "Natthi ācariyo nāma, ",
  "ja545:36.4": "adantaṃ ko damessati. ",
  "ja545:37.1": "1189. ‘‘‘Samatulyāni bhūtāni, ",
  "ja545:37.2": "natthi jeṭṭhāpacāyikā; ",
  "ja545:37.3": "Natthi balaṃ vīriyaṃ vā, ",
  "ja545:37.4": "kuto uṭṭhānaporisaṃ; ",
  "ja545:37.5": "Niyatāni hi bhūtāni, ",
  "ja545:37.6": "yathā goṭaviso tathā. ",
  "ja545:38.1": "1190. ‘‘‘Laddheyyaṃ labhate macco, ",
  "ja545:38.2": "tattha dānaphalaṃ kuto; ",
  "ja545:38.3": "Natthi dānaphalaṃ deva, ",
  "ja545:38.4": "avaso devavīriyo. ",
  "ja545:39.1": "1191. ‘‘‘Bālehi dānaṃ paññattaṃ, ",
  "ja545:39.2": "paṇḍitehi paṭicchitaṃ; ",
  "ja545:39.3": "Avasā denti dhīrānaṃ, ",
  "ja545:39.4": "bālā paṇḍitamānino. ",
  "ja545:40.1": "1192. ‘‘‘Sattime sassatā kāyā, ",
  "ja545:40.2": "acchejjā avikopino; ",
  "ja545:40.3": "Tejo pathavī āpo ca, ",
  "ja545:40.4": "vāyo sukhaṃ dukhañcime; ",
  "ja545:40.5": "Jīve ca sattime kāyā, ",
  "ja545:40.6": "yesaṃ chettā na vijjati. ",
  "ja545:41.1": "1193. ‘‘‘Natthi hantā va chettā vā, ",
  "ja545:41.2": "haññe yevāpi koci naṃ; ",
  "ja545:41.3": "Antareneva kāyānaṃ, ",
  "ja545:41.4": "satthāni vītivattare. ",
  "ja545:42.1": "1194. ‘‘‘Yo cāpi siramādāya, ",
  "ja545:42.2": "paresaṃ nisitāsinā; ",
  "ja545:42.3": "Na so chindati te kāye, ",
  "ja545:42.4": "tattha pāpaphalaṃ kuto. ",
  "ja545:43.1": "1195. ‘‘‘Cullāsītimahākappe, ",
  "ja545:43.2": "sabbe sujjhanti saṃsaraṃ; ",
  "ja545:43.3": "Anāgate tamhi kāle, ",
  "ja545:43.4": "saññatopi na sujjhati. ",
  "ja545:44.1": "1196. ‘‘‘Caritvāpi bahuṃ bhadraṃ, ",
  "ja545:44.2": "neva sujjhantināgate; ",
  "ja545:44.3": "Pāpañcepi bahuṃ katvā, ",
  "ja545:44.4": "taṃ khaṇaṃ nātivattare. ",
  "ja545:45.1": "1197. ‘‘‘Anupubbena no suddhi, ",
  "ja545:45.2": "kappānaṃ cullasītiyā; ",
  "ja545:45.3": "Niyatiṃ nātivattāma, ",
  "ja545:45.4": "velantamiva sāgaro’’’. ",
  "ja545:46.1": "1198. Kassapassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:46.2": "alāto etadabravi; ",
  "ja545:46.3": "‘‘Yathā bhadanto bhaṇati, ",
  "ja545:46.4": "mayhampetaṃva ruccati. ",
  "ja545:47.1": "1199. ‘‘Ahampi purimaṃ jātiṃ, ",
  "ja545:47.2": "sare saṃsaritattano; ",
  "ja545:47.3": "Piṅgalo nāmahaṃ āsiṃ, ",
  "ja545:47.4": "luddo goghātako pure. ",
  "ja545:48.1": "1200. ‘‘Bārāṇasiyaṃ phītāyaṃ, ",
  "ja545:48.2": "bahuṃ pāpaṃ kataṃ mayā; ",
  "ja545:48.3": "Bahū mayā hatā pāṇā, ",
  "ja545:48.4": "mahiṃsā sūkarā ajā. ",
  "ja545:49.1": "1201. ‘‘Tato cuto idha jāto, ",
  "ja545:49.2": "iddhe senāpatīkule; ",
  "ja545:49.3": "Natthi nūna phalaṃ pāpaṃ, ",
  "ja545:49.4": "yohaṃ na nirayaṃ gato. ",
  "ja545:50.1": "1202. Athettha bījako nāma, ",
  "ja545:50.2": "dāso āsi paṭaccarī ; ",
  "ja545:50.3": "Uposathaṃ upavasanto, ",
  "ja545:50.4": "guṇasantikupāgami. ",
  "ja545:51.1": "1203. Kassapassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:51.2": "alātassa ca bhāsitaṃ; ",
  "ja545:51.3": "Passasanto muhuṃ uṇhaṃ, ",
  "ja545:51.4": "rudaṃ assūni vattayi. ",
  "ja545:52.1": "1204. Tamanupucchi vedeho, ",
  "ja545:52.2": "‘‘kimatthaṃ samma rodasi; ",
  "ja545:52.3": "Kiṃ te sutaṃ vā diṭṭhaṃ vā, ",
  "ja545:52.4": "kiṃ maṃ vedesi vedanaṃ’’. ",
  "ja545:53.1": "1205. Vedehassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:53.2": "bījako etadabravi; ",
  "ja545:53.3": "‘‘Natthi me vedanā dukkhā, ",
  "ja545:53.4": "mahārāja suṇohi me. ",
  "ja545:54.1": "1206. ‘‘Ahampi purimaṃ jātiṃ, ",
  "ja545:54.2": "sarāmi sukhamattano; ",
  "ja545:54.3": "Sāketāhaṃ pure āsiṃ, ",
  "ja545:54.4": "bhāvaseṭṭhi guṇe rato. ",
  "ja545:55.1": "1207. ‘‘Sammato brāhmaṇibbhānaṃ, ",
  "ja545:55.2": "saṃvibhāgarato suci; ",
  "ja545:55.3": "Na cāpi pāpakaṃ kammaṃ, ",
  "ja545:55.4": "sarāmi katamattano. ",
  "ja545:56.1": "1208. ‘‘Tato cutāhaṃ vedeha, ",
  "ja545:56.2": "idha jāto duritthiyā; ",
  "ja545:56.3": "Gabbhamhi kumbhadāsiyā, ",
  "ja545:56.4": "yato jāto suduggato. ",
  "ja545:57.1": "1209. ‘‘Evampi duggato santo, ",
  "ja545:57.2": "samacariyaṃ adhiṭṭhito; ",
  "ja545:57.3": "Upaḍḍhabhāgaṃ bhattassa, ",
  "ja545:57.4": "dadāmi yo me icchati. ",
  "ja545:58.1": "1210. ‘‘Cātuddasiṃ pañcadasiṃ, ",
  "ja545:58.2": "sadā upavasāmahaṃ; ",
  "ja545:58.3": "Na cāpi bhūte hiṃsāmi, ",
  "ja545:58.4": "theyyañcāpi vivajjayiṃ. ",
  "ja545:59.1": "1211. ‘‘Sabbameva hi nūnetaṃ, ",
  "ja545:59.2": "suciṇṇaṃ bhavati nipphalaṃ; ",
  "ja545:59.3": "Niratthaṃ maññidaṃ sīlaṃ, ",
  "ja545:59.4": "alāto bhāsatī yathā. ",
  "ja545:60.1": "1212. ‘‘Kalimeva nūna gaṇhāmi, ",
  "ja545:60.2": "asippo dhuttako yathā; ",
  "ja545:60.3": "Kaṭaṃ alāto gaṇhāti, ",
  "ja545:60.4": "kitavosikkhito yathā. ",
  "ja545:61.1": "1213. ‘‘Dvāraṃ nappaṭipassāmi, ",
  "ja545:61.2": "yena gacchāmi suggatiṃ; ",
  "ja545:61.3": "Tasmā rāja parodāmi, ",
  "ja545:61.4": "sutvā kassapabhāsitaṃ’’. ",
  "ja545:62.1": "1214. Bījakassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:62.2": "rājā aṅgati mabravi; ",
  "ja545:62.3": "‘‘Natthi dvāraṃ sugatiyā, ",
  "ja545:62.4": "niyatiṃ kaṅkha bījaka. ",
  "ja545:63.1": "1215. ‘‘Sukhaṃ vā yadi vā dukkhaṃ, ",
  "ja545:63.2": "niyatiyā kira labbhati; ",
  "ja545:63.3": "Saṃsārasuddhi sabbesaṃ, ",
  "ja545:63.4": "mā turittho anāgate. ",
  "ja545:64.1": "1216. ‘‘Ahampi pubbe kalyāṇo, ",
  "ja545:64.2": "brāhmaṇibbhesu byāvaṭo ; ",
  "ja545:64.3": "Vohāramanusāsanto, ",
  "ja545:64.4": "ratihīno tadantarā’’. ",
  "ja545:65.1": "1217. ‘‘Punapi bhante dakkhemu, ",
  "ja545:65.2": "saṅgati ce bhavissati’’; ",
  "ja545:65.3": "Idaṃ vatvāna vedeho, ",
  "ja545:65.4": "paccagā sanivesanaṃ. ",
  "ja545:66.1": "1218. Tato ratyā vivasāne, ",
  "ja545:66.2": "upaṭṭhānamhi aṅgati; ",
  "ja545:66.3": "Amacce sannipātetvā, ",
  "ja545:66.4": "idaṃ vacanamabravi. ",
  "ja545:67.1": "1219. ‘‘Candake me vimānasmiṃ, ",
  "ja545:67.2": "sadā kāme vidhentu me; ",
  "ja545:67.3": "Mā upagacchuṃ atthesu, ",
  "ja545:67.4": "guyhappakāsiyesu ca. ",
  "ja545:68.1": "1220. ‘‘Vijayo ca sunāmo ca, ",
  "ja545:68.2": "senāpati alātako; ",
  "ja545:68.3": "Ete atthe nisīdantu, ",
  "ja545:68.4": "vohārakusalā tayo’’. ",
  "ja545:69.1": "1221. Idaṃ vatvāna vedeho, ",
  "ja545:69.2": "kāmeva bahumaññatha; ",
  "ja545:69.3": "Na cāpi brāhmaṇibbhesu, ",
  "ja545:69.4": "atthe kismiñci byāvaṭo. ",
  "ja545:70.1": "1222. Tato dvesattarattassa, ",
  "ja545:70.2": "vedehassatrajā piyā; ",
  "ja545:70.3": "Rājakaññā rucā nāma, ",
  "ja545:70.4": "dhātimātaramabravi. ",
  "ja545:71.1": "1223. ‘Alaṅkarotha maṃ khippaṃ, ",
  "ja545:71.2": "sakhiyo cālaṅkarontu me; ",
  "ja545:71.3": "Suve pannaraso dibyo, ",
  "ja545:71.4": "gacchaṃ issarasantike’ . ",
  "ja545:72.1": "1224. Tassā mālyaṃ abhihariṃsu, ",
  "ja545:72.2": "candanañca mahārahaṃ; ",
  "ja545:72.3": "Maṇisaṅkhamuttāratanaṃ, ",
  "ja545:72.4": "nānāratte ca ambare. ",
  "ja545:73.1": "1225. Tañca sovaṇṇaye pīṭhe, ",
  "ja545:73.2": "nisinnaṃ bahukitthiyo; ",
  "ja545:73.3": "Parikiriya pasobhiṃsu , ",
  "ja545:73.4": "rucaṃ ruciravaṇṇiniṃ. ",
  "ja545:74.1": "1226. Sā ca sakhimajjhagatā, ",
  "ja545:74.2": "sabbābharaṇabhūsitā; ",
  "ja545:74.3": "Sateratā abbhamiva, ",
  "ja545:74.4": "candakaṃ pāvisī rucā. ",
  "ja545:75.1": "1227. Upasaṅkamitvā vedehaṃ, ",
  "ja545:75.2": "vanditvā vinaye rataṃ; ",
  "ja545:75.3": "Suvaṇṇakhacite pīṭhe, ",
  "ja545:75.4": "ekamantaṃ upāvisi’’. ",
  "ja545:76.1": "1228. Tañca disvāna vedeho, ",
  "ja545:76.2": "accharānaṃva saṅgamaṃ; ",
  "ja545:76.3": "Rucaṃ sakhimajjhagataṃ, ",
  "ja545:76.4": "idaṃ vacanamabravi. ",
  "ja545:77.1": "1229. ‘‘Kacci ramasi pāsāde, ",
  "ja545:77.2": "antopokkharaṇiṃ pati; ",
  "ja545:77.3": "Kacci bahuvidhaṃ khajjaṃ, ",
  "ja545:77.4": "sadā abhiharanti te. ",
  "ja545:78.1": "1230. ‘‘Kacci bahuvidhaṃ mālyaṃ, ",
  "ja545:78.2": "ocinitvā kumāriyo; ",
  "ja545:78.3": "Gharake karotha paccekaṃ, ",
  "ja545:78.4": "khiḍḍāratiratā muhuṃ . ",
  "ja545:79.1": "1231. ‘‘Kena vā vikalaṃ tuyhaṃ, ",
  "ja545:79.2": "kiṃ khippaṃ āharantu te; ",
  "ja545:79.3": "Manokarassu kuḍḍamukhī , ",
  "ja545:79.4": "api candasamamhipi’’ . ",
  "ja545:80.1": "1232. Vedehassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:80.2": "rucā pitaramabravi; ",
  "ja545:80.3": "‘‘Sabbametaṃ mahārāja, ",
  "ja545:80.4": "labbhatissarasantike. ",
  "ja545:81.1": "1233. ‘‘Suve pannaraso dibyo, ",
  "ja545:81.2": "sahassaṃ āharantu me; ",
  "ja545:81.3": "Yathādinnañca dassāmi, ",
  "ja545:81.4": "dānaṃ sabbavanīsvahaṃ’’ . ",
  "ja545:82.1": "1234. Rucāya vacanaṃ sutvā, ",
  "ja545:82.2": "rājā aṅgati mabravi; ",
  "ja545:82.3": "‘‘Bahuṃ vināsitaṃ vittaṃ, ",
  "ja545:82.4": "niratthaṃ aphalaṃ tayā. ",
  "ja545:83.1": "1235. ‘‘Uposathe vasaṃ niccaṃ, ",
  "ja545:83.2": "annapānaṃ na bhuñjasi; ",
  "ja545:83.3": "Niyatetaṃ abhuttabbaṃ, ",
  "ja545:83.4": "natthi puññaṃ abhuñjato’’. ",
  "ja545:84.1": "1236. ‘‘Bījakopi hi sutvāna, ",
  "ja545:84.2": "tadā kassapabhāsitaṃ; ",
  "ja545:84.3": "Passasanto muhuṃ uṇhaṃ, ",
  "ja545:84.4": "rudaṃ assūni vattayi. ",
  "ja545:85.1": "1237. ‘‘Yāva ruce jīvamānā , ",
  "ja545:85.2": "mā bhattamapanāmayi; ",
  "ja545:85.3": "Natthi bhadde paro loko, ",
  "ja545:85.4": "kiṃ niratthaṃ vihaññasi’’. ",
  "ja545:86.1": "1238. Vedehassa vaco sutvā, ",
  "ja545:86.2": "rucā ruciravaṇṇinī; ",
  "ja545:86.3": "Jānaṃ pubbāparaṃ dhammaṃ, ",
  "ja545:86.4": "pitaraṃ etadabravi. ",
  "ja545:87.1": "1239. ‘‘Sutameva pure āsi, ",
  "ja545:87.2": "sakkhi diṭṭhamidaṃ mayā; ",
  "ja545:87.3": "Bālūpasevī yo hoti, ",
  "ja545:87.4": "bālova samapajjatha. ",
  "ja545:88.1": "1240. ‘‘Mūḷho hi mūḷhamāgamma, ",
  "ja545:88.2": "bhiyyo mohaṃ nigacchati; ",
  "ja545:88.3": "Patirūpaṃ alātena, ",
  "ja545:88.4": "bījakena ca muyhituṃ. ",
  "ja545:89.1": "1241. ‘‘Tvañca devāsi sappañño, ",
  "ja545:89.2": "dhīro atthassa kovido; ",
  "ja545:89.3": "Kathaṃ bālehi sadisaṃ, ",
  "ja545:89.4": "hīnadiṭṭhiṃ upāgami. ",
  "ja545:90.1": "1242. ‘‘Sacepi saṃsārapathena sujjhati, ",
  "ja545:90.2": "niratthiyā pabbajjā guṇassa; ",
  "ja545:90.3": "Kīṭova aggiṃ jalitaṃ apāpataṃ, ",
  "ja545:90.4": "upapajjati mohamūḷho naggabhāvaṃ. ",
  "ja545:91.1": "1243. ‘‘Saṃsārasuddhīti pure niviṭṭhā, ",
  "ja545:91.2": "kammaṃ vidūsenti bahū ajānaṃ ; ",
  "ja545:91.3": "Pubbe kalī duggahitovaatthā , ",
  "ja545:91.4": "dummo ca yā balisā ambujova. ",
  "ja545:92.1": "1244. ‘‘Upamaṃ te karissāmi, ",
  "ja545:92.2": "mahārāja tavatthiyā; ",
  "ja545:92.3": "Upamāya midhekacce, ",
  "ja545:92.4": "atthaṃ jānanti paṇḍitā. ",
  "ja545:93.1": "1245. ‘‘Vāṇijānaṃ yathā nāvā, ",
  "ja545:93.2": "appamāṇabharā garu; ",
  "ja545:93.3": "Atibhāraṃ samādāya, ",
  "ja545:93.4": "aṇṇave avasīdati. ",
  "ja545:94.1": "1246. ‘‘Evameva naro pāpaṃ, ",
  "ja545:94.2": "thokaṃ thokampi ācinaṃ; ",
  "ja545:94.3": "Atibhāraṃ samādāya, ",
  "ja545:94.4": "niraye avasīdati. ",
  "ja545:95.1": "1247. ‘‘Na tāva bhāro paripūro, ",
  "ja545:95.2": "alātassa mahīpati; ",
  "ja545:95.3": "Ācināti ca taṃ pāpaṃ, ",
  "ja545:95.4": "yena gacchati duggatiṃ. ",
  "ja545:96.1": "1248. ‘‘Pubbevassa kataṃ puññaṃ, ",
  "ja545:96.2": "alātassa mahīpati; ",
  "ja545:96.3": "Tasseva deva nissando, ",
  "ja545:96.4": "yañceso labhate sukhaṃ. ",
  "ja545:97.1": "1249. ‘‘Khīyate cassa taṃ puññaṃ, ",
  "ja545:97.2": "tathā hi aguṇe rato; ",
  "ja545:97.3": "Ujumaggaṃ avahāya , ",
  "ja545:97.4": "kummaggamanudhāvati. ",
  "ja545:98.1": "1250. ‘‘Tulā yathā paggahitā, ",
  "ja545:98.2": "ohite tulamaṇḍale; ",
  "ja545:98.3": "Unnameti tulāsīsaṃ, ",
  "ja545:98.4": "bhāre oropite sati. ",
  "ja545:99.1": "1251. ‘‘Evameva naro puññaṃ, ",
  "ja545:99.2": "thokaṃ thokampi ācinaṃ; ",
  "ja545:99.3": "Saggātimāno dāsova, ",
  "ja545:99.4": "bījako sātave rato. ",
  "ja545:100.1": "1252. ‘‘Yamajja bījako dāso, ",
  "ja545:100.2": "dukkhaṃ passati attani; ",
  "ja545:100.3": "Pubbevassa kataṃ pāpaṃ, ",
  "ja545:100.4": "tameso paṭisevati. ",
  "ja545:101.1": "1253. ‘‘Khīyate cassa taṃ pāpaṃ, ",
  "ja545:101.2": "tathā hi vinaye rato; ",
  "ja545:101.3": "Kassapañca samāpajja, ",
  "ja545:101.4": "mā hevuppathamāgamā. ",
  "ja545:102.1": "1254. ‘‘Yaṃ yañhi rāja bhajati, ",
  "ja545:102.2": "santaṃ vā yadi vā asaṃ; ",
  "ja545:102.3": "Sīlavantaṃ visīlaṃ vā, ",
  "ja545:102.4": "vasaṃ tasseva gacchati. ",
  "ja545:103.1": "1255. ‘‘Yādisaṃ kurute mittaṃ, ",
  "ja545:103.2": "yādisaṃ cūpasevati; ",
  "ja545:103.3": "Sopi tādisako hoti, ",
  "ja545:103.4": "sahavāso hi tādiso. ",
  "ja545:104.1": "1256. ‘‘Sevamāno sevamānaṃ, ",
  "ja545:104.2": "samphuṭṭho samphusaṃ paraṃ; ",
  "ja545:104.3": "Saro diddho kalāpaṃva, ",
  "ja545:104.4": "alittamupalimpati; ",
  "ja545:104.5": "Upalepabhayā dhīro, ",
  "ja545:104.6": "neva pāpasakhā siyā. ",
  "ja545:105.1": "1257. ‘‘Pūtimacchaṃ kusaggena, ",
  "ja545:105.2": "yo naro upanayhati; ",
  "ja545:105.3": "Kusāpi pūti vāyanti, ",
  "ja545:105.4": "evaṃ bālūpasevanā. ",
  "ja545:106.1": "1258. ‘‘Tagarañca palāsena, ",
  "ja545:106.2": "yo naro upanayhati; ",
  "ja545:106.3": "Pattāpi surabhi vāyanti, ",
  "ja545:106.4": "evaṃ dhīrūpasevanā. ",
  "ja545:107.1": "1259. ‘‘Tasmā pattapuṭasseva , ",
  "ja545:107.2": "ñatvā sampākamattano; ",
  "ja545:107.3": "Asante nopaseveyya, ",
  "ja545:107.4": "sante seveyya paṇḍito; ",
  "ja545:107.5": "Asanto nirayaṃ nenti, ",
  "ja545:107.6": "santo pāpenti suggatiṃ’’. ",
  "ja545:108.1": "1260. Ahampi jātiyo satta, ",
  "ja545:108.2": "sare saṃsaritattano; ",
  "ja545:108.3": "Anāgatāpi satteva, ",
  "ja545:108.4": "yā gamissaṃ ito cutā. ",
  "ja545:109.1": "1261. ‘‘Yā me sā sattamī jāti, ",
  "ja545:109.2": "ahu pubbe janādhipa; ",
  "ja545:109.3": "Kammāraputto magadhesu, ",
  "ja545:109.4": "ahuṃ rājagahe pure. ",
  "ja545:110.1": "1262. ‘‘Pāpaṃ sahāyamāgamma, ",
  "ja545:110.2": "bahuṃ pāpaṃ kataṃ mayā; ",
  "ja545:110.3": "Paradārassa heṭhento, ",
  "ja545:110.4": "carimhā amarā viya. ",
  "ja545:111.1": "1263. ‘‘Taṃ kammaṃ nihitaṃ aṭṭhā, ",
  "ja545:111.2": "bhasmacchannova pāvako; ",
  "ja545:111.3": "Atha aññehi kammehi, ",
  "ja545:111.4": "ajāyiṃ vaṃsabhūmiyaṃ. ",
  "ja545:112.1": "1264. ‘‘Kosambiyaṃ seṭṭhikule, ",
  "ja545:112.2": "iddhe phīte mahaddhane; ",
  "ja545:112.3": "Ekaputto mahārāja, ",
  "ja545:112.4": "niccaṃ sakkatapūjito. ",
  "ja545:113.1": "1265. ‘‘Tattha mittaṃ asevissaṃ, ",
  "ja545:113.2": "sahāyaṃ sātave rataṃ; ",
  "ja545:113.3": "Paṇḍitaṃ sutasampannaṃ, ",
  "ja545:113.4": "so maṃ atthe nivesayi. ",
  "ja545:114.1": "1266. ‘‘Cātuddasiṃ pañcadasiṃ, ",
  "ja545:114.2": "bahuṃ rattiṃ upāvasiṃ; ",
  "ja545:114.3": "Taṃ kammaṃ nihitaṃ aṭṭhā, ",
  "ja545:114.4": "nidhīva udakantike. ",
  "ja545:115.1": "1267. ‘‘Atha pāpāna kammānaṃ, ",
  "ja545:115.2": "yametaṃ magadhe kataṃ; ",
  "ja545:115.3": "Phalaṃ pariyāga maṃ pacchā, ",
  "ja545:115.4": "bhutvā duṭṭhavisaṃ yathā. ",
  "ja545:116.1": "1268. ‘‘Tato cutāhaṃ vedeha, ",
  "ja545:116.2": "roruve niraye ciraṃ; ",
  "ja545:116.3": "Sakammunā apaccissaṃ, ",
  "ja545:116.4": "taṃ saraṃ na sukhaṃ labhe. ",
  "ja545:117.1": "1269. ‘‘Bahuvassagaṇe tattha, ",
  "ja545:117.2": "khepayitvā bahuṃ dukhaṃ; ",
  "ja545:117.3": "Bhinnāgate ahuṃ rāja, ",
  "ja545:117.4": "chagalo uddhatapphalo . ",
  "ja545:118.1": "1270. ‘‘Sātaputtā mayā vūḷhā, ",
  "ja545:118.2": "piṭṭhiyā ca rathena ca; ",
  "ja545:118.3": "Tassa kammassa nissando, ",
  "ja545:118.4": "paradāragamanassa me. ",
  "ja545:119.1": "1271. ‘‘Tato cutāhaṃ vedeha, ",
  "ja545:119.2": "kapi āsiṃ brahāvane; ",
  "ja545:119.3": "Niluñcitaphalo yeva, ",
  "ja545:119.4": "yūthapena pagabbhinā; ",
  "ja545:119.5": "Tassa kammassa nissando, ",
  "ja545:119.6": "paradāragamanassa me. ",
  "ja545:120.1": "1272. ‘‘Tato cutāhaṃ vedeha, ",
  "ja545:120.2": "dassanesu pasū ahuṃ; ",
  "ja545:120.3": "Niluñcito javo bhadro, ",
  "ja545:120.4": "yoggaṃ vūḷhaṃ ciraṃ mayā; ",
  "ja545:120.5": "Tassa kammassa nissando, ",
  "ja545:120.6": "paradāragamanassa me. ",
  "ja545:121.1": "1273. ‘‘Tato cutāhaṃ vedeha, ",
  "ja545:121.2": "vajjīsu kulamāgamā; ",
  "ja545:121.3": "Nevitthī na pumā āsiṃ, ",
  "ja545:121.4": "manussatte sudullabhe; ",
  "ja545:121.5": "Tassa kammassa nissando, ",
  "ja545:121.6": "paradāragamanassa me. ",
  "ja545:122.1": "1274. ‘‘Tato cutāhaṃ vedeha, ",
  "ja545:122.2": "ajāyiṃ nandane vane; ",
  "ja545:122.3": "Bhavane tāvatiṃsāhaṃ, ",
  "ja545:122.4": "accharā kāmavaṇṇinī . ",
  "ja545:123.1": "1275. ‘‘Vicittavatthābharaṇā, ",
  "ja545:123.2": "āmuttamaṇikuṇḍalā; ",
  "ja545:123.3": "Kusalā naccagītassa, ",
  "ja545:123.4": "sakkassa paricārikā. ",
  "ja545:124.1": "1276. ‘‘Tattha ṭhitāhaṃ vedeha, ",
  "ja545:124.2": "sarāmi jātiyo imā; ",
  "ja545:124.3": "Anāgatāpi satteva, ",
  "ja545:124.4": "yā gamissaṃ ito cutā. ",
  "ja545:125.1": "1277. ‘‘Pariyāgataṃ taṃ kusalaṃ, ",
  "ja545:125.2": "yaṃ me kosambiyaṃ kataṃ; ",
  "ja545:125.3": "Deve ceva manusse ca, ",
  "ja545:125.4": "sandhāvissaṃ ito cutā. ",
  "ja545:126.1": "1278. ‘‘Satta jacco mahārāja, ",
  "ja545:126.2": "niccaṃ sakkatapūjitā; ",
  "ja545:126.3": "Thībhāvāpi na muccissaṃ, ",
  "ja545:126.4": "chaṭṭhā nigatiyo imā. ",
  "ja545:127.1": "1279. ‘‘Sattamī ca gati deva, ",
  "ja545:127.2": "devaputto mahiddhiko; ",
  "ja545:127.3": "Pumā devo bhavissāmi , ",
  "ja545:127.4": "devakāyasmimuttamo. ",
  "ja545:128.1": "1280. ‘‘Ajjāpi santānamayaṃ, ",
  "ja545:128.2": "mālaṃ ganthenti nandane; ",
  "ja545:128.3": "Devaputto javo nāma, ",
  "ja545:128.4": "yo me mālaṃ paṭicchati. ",
  "ja545:129.1": "1281. ‘‘Muhutto viya so dibyo, ",
  "ja545:129.2": "idha vassāni soḷasa; ",
  "ja545:129.3": "Rattindivo ca so dibyo, ",
  "ja545:129.4": "mānusiṃ saradosataṃ. ",
  "ja545:130.1": "1282. ‘‘Iti kammāni anventi, ",
  "ja545:130.2": "asaṅkheyyāpi jātiyo; ",
  "ja545:130.3": "Kalyāṇaṃ yadi vā pāpaṃ, ",
  "ja545:130.4": "na hi kammaṃ vinassati . ",
  "ja545:131.1": "1283. ‘‘Yo icche puriso hotuṃ, ",
  "ja545:131.2": "jātiṃ jātiṃ punappunaṃ; ",
  "ja545:131.3": "Paradāraṃ vivajjeyya, ",
  "ja545:131.4": "dhotapādova kaddamaṃ. ",
  "ja545:132.1": "1284. ‘‘Yā icche puriso hotuṃ, ",
  "ja545:132.2": "jātiṃ jātiṃ punappunaṃ; ",
  "ja545:132.3": "Sāmikaṃ apacāyeyya, ",
  "ja545:132.4": "indaṃva paricārikā. ",
  "ja545:133.1": "1285. ‘‘Yo icche dibyabhogañca, ",
  "ja545:133.2": "dibbamāyuṃ yasaṃ sukhaṃ; ",
  "ja545:133.3": "Pāpāni parivajjetvā , ",
  "ja545:133.4": "tividhaṃ dhammamācare. ",
  "ja545:134.1": "1286. ‘‘Kāyena vācā manasā, ",
  "ja545:134.2": "appamatto vicakkhaṇo; ",
  "ja545:134.3": "Attano hoti atthāya, ",
  "ja545:134.4": "itthī vā yadi vā pumā. ",
  "ja545:135.1": "1287. ‘‘Ye kecime mānujā jīvaloke, ",
  "ja545:135.2": "yasassino sabbasamantabhogā; ",
  "ja545:135.3": "Asaṃsayaṃ tehi pure suciṇṇaṃ, ",
  "ja545:135.4": "kammassakāse puthu sabbasattā. ",
  "ja545:136.1": "1288. ‘‘Iṅghānucintesi sayampi deva, ",
  "ja545:136.2": "kutonidānā te imā janinda; ",
  "ja545:136.3": "Yā te imā accharāsannikāsā, ",
  "ja545:136.4": "alaṅkatā kañcanajālachannā’’. ",
  "ja545:137.1": "1289. Iccevaṃ pitaraṃ kaññā, ",
  "ja545:137.2": "rucā tosesi aṅgatiṃ; ",
  "ja545:137.3": "Mūḷhassa maggamācikkhi, ",
  "ja545:137.4": "dhammamakkhāsi subbatā. ",
  "ja545:138.1": "1290. Athāgamā brahmalokā, ",
  "ja545:138.2": "nārado mānusiṃ pajaṃ; ",
  "ja545:138.3": "Jambudīpaṃ avekkhanto, ",
  "ja545:138.4": "addā rājānamaṅgatiṃ. ",
  "ja545:139.1": "1291. ‘‘Tato patiṭṭhā pāsāde, ",
  "ja545:139.2": "vedehassa puratthato ; ",
  "ja545:139.3": "Tañca disvānānuppattaṃ, ",
  "ja545:139.4": "rucā isimavandatha. ",
  "ja545:140.1": "1292. ‘‘Athāsanamhā oruyha, ",
  "ja545:140.2": "rājā byathitamānaso ; ",
  "ja545:140.3": "Nāradaṃ paripucchanto, ",
  "ja545:140.4": "idaṃ vacanamabravi. ",
  "ja545:141.1": "1293. ‘‘Kuto nu āgacchasi devavaṇṇi, ",
  "ja545:141.2": "obhāsayaṃ sabbadisā candimāva; ",
  "ja545:141.3": "Akkhāhi me pucchito nāmagottaṃ, ",
  "ja545:141.4": "kathaṃ taṃ jānanti manussaloke’’. ",
  "ja545:142.1": "1294. ‘‘Ahañhi devato idāni emi, ",
  "ja545:142.2": "obhāsayaṃ sabbadisā candimāva; ",
  "ja545:142.3": "Akkhāmi te pucchito nāmagottaṃ, ",
  "ja545:142.4": "jānanti maṃ nārado kassapo ca’’. ",
  "ja545:143.1": "1295. ‘‘Accherarūpaṃ tava yādisañca, ",
  "ja545:143.2": "vehāyasaṃ gacchasi tiṭṭhasī ca; ",
  "ja545:143.3": "Pucchāmi taṃ nārada etamatthaṃ, ",
  "ja545:143.4": "atha kena vaṇṇena tavāyamiddhi’’. ",
  "ja545:144.1": "1296. ‘‘Saccañca dhammo ca damo ca cāgo, ",
  "ja545:144.2": "guṇā mamete pakatā purāṇā; ",
  "ja545:144.3": "Teheva dhammehi susevitehi, ",
  "ja545:144.4": "manojavo yena kāmaṃ gatosmi’’. ",
  "ja545:145.1": "1297. ‘‘Accheramācikkhasi puññasiddhiṃ, ",
  "ja545:145.2": "sace hi etehi yathā vadesi; ",
  "ja545:145.3": "Pucchāmi taṃ nārada etamatthaṃ, ",
  "ja545:145.4": "puṭṭho ca me sādhu viyākarohi’’. ",
  "ja545:146.1": "1298. ‘‘Pucchassu maṃ rāja tavesa attho, ",
  "ja545:146.2": "yaṃ saṃsayaṃ kuruse bhūmipāla; ",
  "ja545:146.3": "Ahaṃ taṃ nissaṃsayataṃ gamemi, ",
  "ja545:146.4": "nayehi ñāyehi ca hetubhī ca’’. ",
  "ja545:147.1": "1299. ‘‘Pucchāmi taṃ nārada etamatthaṃ, ",
  "ja545:147.2": "puṭṭho ca me nārada mā musā bhaṇi; ",
  "ja545:147.3": "Atthi nu devā pitaro nu atthi, ",
  "ja545:147.4": "loko paro atthi jano yamāhu’’. ",
  "ja545:148.1": "1300. ‘‘Attheva devā pitaro ca atthi, ",
  "ja545:148.2": "loko paro atthi jano yamāhu; ",
  "ja545:148.3": "Kāmesu giddhā ca narā pamūḷhā, ",
  "ja545:148.4": "lokaṃ paraṃ na vidū mohayuttā’’. ",
  "ja545:149.1": "1301. ‘‘Atthīti ce nārada saddahāsi, ",
  "ja545:149.2": "nivesanaṃ paraloke matānaṃ; ",
  "ja545:149.3": "Idheva me pañca satāni dehi, ",
  "ja545:149.4": "dassāmi te paraloke sahassaṃ’’. ",
  "ja545:150.1": "1302. ‘‘Dajjemu kho pañca satāni bhoto, ",
  "ja545:150.2": "jaññāmu ce sīlavantaṃ vadaññuṃ ; ",
  "ja545:150.3": "Luddaṃ taṃ bhontaṃ niraye vasantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:150.4": "ko codaye paraloke sahassaṃ. ",
  "ja545:151.1": "1303. ‘‘Idheva yo hoti adhammasīlo , ",
  "ja545:151.2": "pāpācāro alaso luddakammo; ",
  "ja545:151.3": "Na paṇḍitā tasmiṃ iṇaṃ dadanti, ",
  "ja545:151.4": "na hi āgamo hoti tathāvidhamhā. ",
  "ja545:152.1": "1304. ‘‘Dakkhañca posaṃ manujā viditvā, ",
  "ja545:152.2": "uṭṭhānakaṃ sīlavantaṃ vadaññuṃ; ",
  "ja545:152.3": "Sayameva bhogehi nimantayanti, ",
  "ja545:152.4": "kammaṃ karitvā puna māharesi’’. ",
  "ja545:153.1": "1305. ‘‘Ito cuto dakkhasi tattha rāja, ",
  "ja545:153.2": "kākolasaṅghehi vikassamānaṃ ; ",
  "ja545:153.3": "Taṃ khajjamānaṃ niraye vasantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:153.4": "kākehi gijjhehi ca senakehi ; ",
  "ja545:153.5": "Sañchinnagattaṃ ruhiraṃ savantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:153.6": "ko codaye paraloke sahassaṃ. ",
  "ja545:154.1": "1306. ‘‘Andhaṃtamaṃ tattha na candasūriyā, ",
  "ja545:154.2": "nirayo sadā tumulo ghorarūpo; ",
  "ja545:154.3": "Sā neva rattī na divā paññāyati, ",
  "ja545:154.4": "tathāvidhe ko vicare dhanatthiko. ",
  "ja545:155.1": "1307. ‘‘Sabalo ca sāmo ca duve suvānā, ",
  "ja545:155.2": "pavaddhakāyā balino mahantā; ",
  "ja545:155.3": "Khādanti dantehi ayomayehi, ",
  "ja545:155.4": "ito paṇunnaṃ paralokapattaṃ . ",
  "ja545:156.1": "1308. ‘‘Taṃ khajjamānaṃ niraye vasantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:156.2": "luddehi vāḷehi aghammigehi ca; ",
  "ja545:156.3": "Sañchinnagattaṃ ruhiraṃ savantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:156.4": "ko codaye paraloke sahassaṃ. ",
  "ja545:157.1": "1309. ‘‘Usūhi sattīhi ca sunisitāhi, ",
  "ja545:157.2": "hananti vijjhanti ca paccamittā ; ",
  "ja545:157.3": "Kāḷūpakāḷā nirayamhi ghore, ",
  "ja545:157.4": "pubbe naraṃ dukkaṭakammakāriṃ. ",
  "ja545:158.1": "1310. ‘‘Taṃ haññamānaṃ niraye vajantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:158.2": "kucchismiṃ passasmiṃ vipphālitūdaraṃ; ",
  "ja545:158.3": "Sañchinnagattaṃ ruhiraṃ savantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:158.4": "ko codaye paraloke sahassaṃ. ",
  "ja545:159.1": "1311. ‘‘Sattī usū tomarabhiṇḍivālā, ",
  "ja545:159.2": "vividhāvudhā vassanti tattha devā; ",
  "ja545:159.3": "Patanti aṅgāramivaccimanto, ",
  "ja545:159.4": "silāsanī vassati luddakamme. ",
  "ja545:160.1": "1312. ‘‘Uṇho ca vāto nirayamhi dussaho, ",
  "ja545:160.2": "na tamhi sukhaṃ labbhati ittarampi; ",
  "ja545:160.3": "Taṃ taṃ vidhāvantamalenamāturaṃ, ",
  "ja545:160.4": "ko codaye paraloke sahassaṃ. ",
  "ja545:161.1": "1313. ‘‘Sandhāvamānampi rathesu yuttaṃ, ",
  "ja545:161.2": "sajotibhūtaṃ pathaviṃ kamantaṃ; ",
  "ja545:161.3": "Patodalaṭṭhīhi sucodayantaṃ , ",
  "ja545:161.4": "ko codaye paraloke sahassaṃ. ",
  "ja545:162.1": "1314. ‘‘Tamāruhantaṃ khurasañcitaṃ giriṃ, ",
  "ja545:162.2": "vibhiṃsanaṃ pajjalitaṃ bhayānakaṃ; ",
  "ja545:162.3": "Sañchinnagattaṃ ruhiraṃ savantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:162.4": "ko codaye paraloke sahassaṃ. ",
  "ja545:163.1": "1315. ‘‘Tamāruhantaṃ pabbatasannikāsaṃ, ",
  "ja545:163.2": "aṅgārarāsiṃ jalitaṃ bhayānakaṃ; ",
  "ja545:163.3": "Sudaḍḍhagattaṃ kapaṇaṃ rudantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:163.4": "ko codaye paraloke sahassaṃ. ",
  "ja545:164.1": "1316. ‘‘Abbhakūṭasamā uccā, ",
  "ja545:164.2": "kaṇṭakanicitā dumā; ",
  "ja545:164.3": "Ayomayehi tikkhehi, ",
  "ja545:164.4": "naralohitapāyibhi. ",
  "ja545:165.1": "1317. ‘‘Tamāruhanti nāriyo, ",
  "ja545:165.2": "narā ca paradāragū; ",
  "ja545:165.3": "Coditā sattihatthehi, ",
  "ja545:165.4": "yamaniddesakāribhi. ",
  "ja545:166.1": "1318. ‘‘Tamāruhantaṃ nirayaṃ, ",
  "ja545:166.2": "simbaliṃ ruharimakkhitaṃ; ",
  "ja545:166.3": "Vidaḍḍhakāyaṃ vitacaṃ, ",
  "ja545:166.4": "āturaṃ gāḷhavedanaṃ. ",
  "ja545:167.1": "1319. ‘‘Passasantaṃ muhuṃ uṇhaṃ, ",
  "ja545:167.2": "pubbakammāparādhikaṃ; ",
  "ja545:167.3": "Dumagge vitacaṃ gattaṃ , ",
  "ja545:167.4": "ko taṃ yāceyya taṃ dhanaṃ. ",
  "ja545:168.1": "1320. ‘‘Abbhakūṭasamā uccā, ",
  "ja545:168.2": "asipattācitā dumā; ",
  "ja545:168.3": "Ayomayehi tikkhehi, ",
  "ja545:168.4": "naralohitapāyibhi. ",
  "ja545:169.1": "1321. ‘‘Tamāruhantaṃ asipattapādapaṃ, ",
  "ja545:169.2": "asīhi tikkhehi ca chijjamānaṃ ; ",
  "ja545:169.3": "Sañchinnagattaṃ ruhiraṃ savantaṃ, ",
  "ja545:169.4": "ko codaye paraloke sahassaṃ. ",
  "ja545:170.1": "1322. ‘‘Tato nikkhantamattaṃ taṃ, ",
  "ja545:170.2": "asipattācitā dumā ; ",
  "ja545:170.3": "Sampatitaṃ vetaraṇiṃ, ",
  "ja545:170.4": "ko taṃ yāceyya taṃ dhanaṃ. ",
  "ja545:171.1": "1323. ‘‘Kharā kharodakā tattā, ",
  "ja545:171.2": "duggā vetaraṇī nadī; ",
  "ja545:171.3": "Ayopokkharasañchannā, ",
  "ja545:171.4": "tikkhā pattehi sandati. ",
  "ja545:172.1": "1324. ‘‘Tattha sañchinnagattaṃ taṃ, ",
  "ja545:172.2": "vuyhantaṃ ruhiramakkhitaṃ; ",
  "ja545:172.3": "Vetaraññe anālambe, ",
  "ja545:172.4": "ko taṃ yāceyya taṃ dhanaṃ’’. ",
  "ja545:173.1": "1325. ‘‘Vedhāmi rukkho viya chijjamāno, ",
  "ja545:173.2": "disaṃ na jānāmi pamūḷhasañño; ",
  "ja545:173.3": "Bhayānutappāmi mahā ca me bhayā, ",
  "ja545:173.4": "sutvāna kathā tava bhāsitā ise. ",
  "ja545:174.1": "1326. ‘‘Āditte vārimajjhaṃva, ",
  "ja545:174.2": "dīpaṃvoghe mahaṇṇave; ",
  "ja545:174.3": "Andhakāreva pajjoto, ",
  "ja545:174.4": "tvaṃ nosi saraṇaṃ ise. ",
  "ja545:175.1": "1327. ‘‘Atthañca dhammaṃ anusāsa maṃ ise, ",
  "ja545:175.2": "atītamaddhā aparādhitaṃ mayā; ",
  "ja545:175.3": "Ācikkha me nārada suddhimaggaṃ, ",
  "ja545:175.4": "yathā ahaṃ no nirayaṃ pateyyaṃ’’. ",
  "ja545:176.1": "1328. ‘‘Yathā ahu dhataraṭṭho ( ) , ",
  "ja545:176.2": "vessāmitto aṭṭhako yāmataggi; ",
  "ja545:176.3": "Usindaro cāpi sivī ca rājā, ",
  "ja545:176.4": "paricārakā samaṇabrāhmaṇānaṃ. ",
  "ja545:177.1": "1329. ‘‘Ete caññe ca rājāno, ",
  "ja545:177.2": "ye saggavisayaṃ gatā; ",
  "ja545:177.3": "Adhammaṃ parivajjetvā, ",
  "ja545:177.4": "dhammaṃ cara mahīpati. ",
  "ja545:178.1": "1330. ‘‘Annahatthā ca te byamhe, ",
  "ja545:178.2": "ghosayantu pure tava; ",
  "ja545:178.3": "Ko chāto ko ca tasito, ",
  "ja545:178.4": "ko mālaṃ ko vilepanaṃ; ",
  "ja545:178.5": "Nānārattānaṃ vatthānaṃ, ",
  "ja545:178.6": "ko naggo paridahissati. ",
  "ja545:179.1": "1331. ‘‘Ko panthe chattamāneti , ",
  "ja545:179.2": "pādukā ca mudū subhā; ",
  "ja545:179.3": "Iti sāyañca pāto ca, ",
  "ja545:179.4": "ghosayantu pure tava. ",
  "ja545:180.1": "1332. ‘‘Jiṇṇaṃ posaṃ gavassañca, ",
  "ja545:180.2": "māssu yuñja yathā pure; ",
  "ja545:180.3": "Parihārañca dajjāsi, ",
  "ja545:180.4": "adhikārakato balī. ",
  "ja545:181.1": "1333. ‘‘Kāyo te rathasaññāto, ",
  "ja545:181.2": "manosārathiko lahu; ",
  "ja545:181.3": "Avihiṃsāsāritakkho, ",
  "ja545:181.4": "saṃvibhāgapaṭicchado. ",
  "ja545:182.1": "1334. ‘‘Pādasaññamanemiyo, ",
  "ja545:182.2": "hatthasaññamapakkharo; ",
  "ja545:182.3": "Kucchisaññamanabbhanto, ",
  "ja545:182.4": "vācāsaññamakūjano. ",
  "ja545:183.1": "1335. ‘‘Saccavākyasamattaṅgo, ",
  "ja545:183.2": "apesuññasusaññato; ",
  "ja545:183.3": "Girāsakhilanelaṅgo, ",
  "ja545:183.4": "mitabhāṇisilesito. ",
  "ja545:184.1": "1336. ‘‘Saddhālobhasusaṅkhāro, ",
  "ja545:184.2": "nivātañjalikubbaro; ",
  "ja545:184.3": "Athaddhatānatīsāko , ",
  "ja545:184.4": "sīlasaṃvaranandhano. ",
  "ja545:185.1": "1337. ‘‘Akkodhanamanugghātī, ",
  "ja545:185.2": "dhammapaṇḍarachattako; ",
  "ja545:185.3": "Bāhusaccamapālambo, ",
  "ja545:185.4": "ṭhitacittamupādhiyo . ",
  "ja545:186.1": "1338. ‘‘Kālaññutācittasāro, ",
  "ja545:186.2": "vesārajjatidaṇḍako; ",
  "ja545:186.3": "Nivātavuttiyottako , ",
  "ja545:186.4": "anatimānayugo lahu. ",
  "ja545:187.1": "1339. ‘‘Alīnacittasanthāro, ",
  "ja545:187.2": "vuddhisevī rajohato; ",
  "ja545:187.3": "Sati patodo dhīrassa, ",
  "ja545:187.4": "dhiti yogo ca rasmiyo. ",
  "ja545:188.1": "1340. ‘‘Mano dantaṃ pathaṃ neti , ",
  "ja545:188.2": "samadantehi vāhibhi; ",
  "ja545:188.3": "Icchā lobho ca kummaggo, ",
  "ja545:188.4": "ujumaggo ca saṃyamo. ",
  "ja545:189.1": "1341. ‘‘Rūpe sadde rase gandhe, ",
  "ja545:189.2": "vāhanassa padhāvato; ",
  "ja545:189.3": "Paññā ākoṭanī rāja, ",
  "ja545:189.4": "tattha attāva sārathi. ",
  "ja545:190.1": "1342. ‘‘Sace etena yānena, ",
  "ja545:190.2": "samacariyā daḷhā dhiti; ",
  "ja545:190.3": "Sabbakāmaduho rāja, ",
  "ja545:190.4": "na jātu nirayaṃ vaje’’. ",
  "ja545:191.1": "1343. ‘‘Alāto devadattosi, ",
  "ja545:191.2": "sunāmo āsi bhaddaji; ",
  "ja545:191.3": "Vijayo sāriputtosi, ",
  "ja545:191.4": "moggallānosi bījako. ",
  "ja545:192.1": "1344. ‘‘Sunakkhatto licchaviputto, ",
  "ja545:192.2": "guṇo āsi acelako; ",
  "ja545:192.3": "Ānando sā rucā āsi, ",
  "ja545:192.4": "yā rājānaṃ pasādayi. ",
  "ja545:193.1": "1345. ‘‘Ūruveḷakassapo rājā, ",
  "ja545:193.2": "pāpadiṭṭhi tadā ahu; ",
  "ja545:193.3": "Mahābrahmā bodhisatto, ",
  "ja545:193.4": "evaṃ dhāretha jātaka’’nti. ",
  "ja545:194.1": "Mahānāradakassapajātakaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ. "
}
